//RS /// FileReader/StdinHandle (dead — E2502, loop-source-only); all HTTPRouter `get`/
//RS /// `post`/`put`/`delete` (closure handler → `emit_router_handler`); HTTPRequest/
//RS /// HTTPResponse accessors (serve-lambda-param slot may be unresolved → AST handle arm
//RS /// wouldn't fire); Arena/Bump/Pool/Fixed (`alloc`/`reset` — the producer
//RS /// `mem.*.new` isn't a covered call, so an allocator never binds in a covered fn);
//RS /// Channel/Sender/Task (`receive`/`send`/`sender`/`detach` — producers not covered);
//RS /// `Match.group` (the `Option<Match>` unwrap chain isn't cleanly reachable).
