//RS /// c109 Phase 13: the resolved return type of a closure-taking core call, matching
//RS /// `infer_core_call` (Source/Sema/CheckerCoreLib.rs). `spawn` → `Task<elem>` (the
//RS /// closure's body type — total from the lowered lambda's return); `serve` → Unit (runs
//RS /// forever); `guard` → `ScopeGuard`. These types are rarely load-bearing in emit (a
//RS /// binding carries sema's `b.ty`), but kept total per the design principle.
